{"id": "86133", "name": "כינוס איברים דומים – שני משתנים וקבוע (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Simplify the following expression by collecting together like terms:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\({{CT:0}}x+{{CT:1}}y-{{CT:2}}x-{{CT:3}}y+5 =\\) [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Group the terms with the same letter, then add their coefficients (the constant stays as it is).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Group the like terms</b><br>In order to collect like terms simply pull out the common factors (the x's and y's in this example) like so:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}x+{{CT:1}}y-{{CT:2}}x-{{CT:3}}y+5 \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ = \\left({{CT:0}}-{{CT:2}}\\right)x+\\left({{CT:1}}-{{CT:3}}\\right)y+5 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Compute the coefficients</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ = {{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "ratsimp", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": false, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "d", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}